The AAR published by this project bundles FFmpeg libraries (libavcodec,
libavutil and libswresample) linked into libffmpegJNI. FFmpeg is licensed under
the GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 or later. FFmpeg is built
without --enable-gpl, --enable-nonfree and --enable-version3.

Source and build instructions for FFmpeg in a released AAR:

- FFmpeg source: the ffmpeg submodule of this repository at the release tag,
  https://github.com/putdotio/media3-ffmpeg-decoder/tags
- Configure flags: libraries/decoder_ffmpeg/src/main/jni/build_ffmpeg.sh in the
  media submodule, with the ffmpegDecoders list in gradle.properties.
- Every AAR carries META-INF/media3-ffmpeg-decoder/ffmpeg-build.txt with the
  exact FFmpeg commit, build script and configure string, and the LGPL text in
  META-INF/media3-ffmpeg-decoder/COPYING.LGPLv2.1.
- To rebuild it, modified or not, follow the README. The JNI wrapper is
  Apache-2.0 source in the media submodule.

